  "details": "VRChat Version: 1231\nDescription of the bug: \nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): I pulled out a camera, set it to hide local player and pointed it at a mirror. I still show up in the camera and so does the camera itself.\nA fix or solution to the camera seeing itself in the mirror could be to introduce a “self mirror mask” setting which would allow a VRChat camera user to avoid appearing in their shots which they don’t want to be in.",
